                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Such a lovely little game! 🏵️ Expect it to be more like a short, interactive educational book, where you get to explore beautifully illustrated places while discovering fun facts about flora and fauna, all while listening to relaxing music and nature sounds.\n\nIf you’re apprehensive about insects, there are quite a few featured here, so it’s worth keeping in mind. As much as I love all creatures, I’m usually a little uneasy around some insects (especially the many-legged ones), but I didn’t feel that way while playing this, as everything is presented through illustrations.\n\nIt’s such a sweet and relaxing little journey, and you can easily finish it in one sitting. It feels like reading a tiny encyclopedia, and it’s a really cute way to learn a few things about nature for all ages! 🤎 ୧ ‧°🐿️\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3792679613",
